@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@branchId = 1
@productId = 1

### Branch product list (omit branchId to use branch 1)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products?branchId={{branchId}}

### Branch product detail
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/{{productId}}?branchId={{branchId}}

### Unknown branch
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products?branchId=2147483647

### Set inventory; read the token from the local process environment
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/inventory/{{branchId}}/{{productId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{$processEnv INVENTORY_ADMIN_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"quantityOnHand": 10}

### Missing authorization (403, or 503 if administration is not configured)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/inventory/{{branchId}}/{{productId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"quantityOnHand": 10}

### Atomic allocation at server prices
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "branchId": 1,
  "name": "Branch stock order",
  "orderDate": "2026-10-27",
  "items": [{"productId": 1, "quantity": 2}]
}

### Existing header-only contract
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"branchId": 1, "name": "Header only", "orderDate": "2026-10-27"}
